  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deutsche Bank Consortium II TA: 2013-2015 incl    premia-subsidy - Deutsche Bank Consortium II: premiesubven</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Deutsche Bank Consortium II TA: 2013-2015 och subvav premie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats inneh&#xe5;ller 2 kompponenter. Dels subventioneras en premie avseende en garanti fr&#xe5;n L&amp;G, dels finansieras en TA-facilitet som    syftar till att de MFIer som omfattas av fonden uppmuntras att        certifieras kring Client Protection (Smart campaign).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution contains 2 components. The first refers to a        subsidy of the premia for a guarantee extended by L&amp;G. The second     component refers to a TA-facility aiming at certifying the MFIs       within the fund in accordnce to the client Protection principles      (Smart Campaign).</narrative>
  </description>
